(Our inference workloads are growing incredibly. With generative AI, inference, which is now ) Tj
T*
(about fast token generation at massive scale, has become incredibly complex. Generative AI is ) Tj
T*
(driving a from-foundation-up full-stack computing platform shift that will transform every ) Tj
T*
(computer interaction. From today's information retrieval model, we are shifting to an answers ) Tj
T*
(and skills generation model of computing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI will understand context and our intentions, be knowledgeable, reason, plan, and perform ) Tj
T*
(tasks. We are fundamentally changing how computing works and what computers can do, from ) Tj
T*
(general-purpose CPU to GPU accelerated computing, from instruction-driven software to ) Tj
T*
(intention-understanding models, from retrieving information to performing skills and, at the ) Tj
T*
(industrial level, from producing software to generating tokens, manufacturing digital ) Tj
T*
(intelligence. Token generation will drive a multiyear build-out of AI factories. Beyond cloud ) Tj
